<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Moody's sets AAA rating on Puma bonds.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Moody's sets AAA rating on Puma bonds.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Thursday it had assigned a AAA rating to the PUMA Masterfund P-6 Series A senior bonds.</p>
<p>PUMA is the mortgage securitisation arm of Macquarie Bank Ltd.</p>
<p>The rating applies to the A$315 million tranche 1F series A senior bonds, the A$135 million tranche 2 series A senior bonds, and the A$25 million tranche 3 series A senior bonds.</p>
<p>Moody's said it did not rate the A$25 million series A subordinated bonds.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
